  "notes": "Manufacturer spec page (blackmagicdesign.com/products/blackmagicvideohub/techspecs) confirmed: 20x 12G-SDI in, 20x 12G-SDI out, reference in (Tri-Sync or Black Burst) and reference terminating loop out, Ethernet 10/100/1000 BASE-T, USB-C computer/control interface, internal 100-240V AC PSU with IEC power cable, 1 rack unit height, 27.5W max. Connector type for SDI/reference (BNC) and power (IEC C13/14) is not explicitly spelled out on the spec page but is standard for this product line and confirmed by known Blackmagic Videohub hardware photos/documentation. Ethernet graded eth-1g since spec states 10/100/1000 BASE-T (gigabit capable). USB-C port is for device configuration/control, not a data-graded interface, so no grade was assigned. Reference in/out are ungraded per instructions (non-SDI/HDMI/DP/USB/RJ45 connector class).",
